OL,3,GNEWSAFormer tennis club site serves up
OL,4,Anew council homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe site of a former tennis club has
OL,7,Fbeen transformed into council housing
OL,8,Fin Wolverhampton.
OL,10,FResidents are due to move into 11
OL,11,Fgas-free council homes on Villiers
OL,12,FAvenue in Bilston: 10 with two bedrooms
OL,13,Fand one with three. They stand where
OL,14,Fthe tennis courts once stood.
OL,16,FEach home has solar panels and an A
OL,17,Fenergy rating, and will be available at
OL,18,Fan "affordable rent," the City of
OL,19,FWolverhampton Council said.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
