OL,3,GNEWSAFormer tennis club site serves up
OL,4,Anew council homes
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There is an increasing demand for
OL,7,Fhousing, and this forms part of our
OL,8,Fpipeline of new council properties we
OL,9,Fare developing to deliver more and
OL,10,Fbetter homes for local people in
OL,11,Fwell-connected neighbourhoods across
OL,12,Fthe city," said councillor Steve Evans,
OL,13,Fthe council's deputy leader.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
